### 1. LOGIN DE ADMINISTRADOR
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ulises_admin",
    "password": "mi-clave-segura"
}

###

### 2. CREAR NUEVO USUARIO (Usando el token del Login)
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

{
    "username": "nuevo_usuario_5",
    "email": "nuevo@correo.com",
    "password": "clave-del-nuevo",
    "role": "user"
}


### VER LISTA DE USUARIOS (Usa el token dinámico del paso anterior para la autorización)
GET http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/nuevo_usuario_5
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

{
    "username": "ulises_BORRAR",
    "email": "ulises_usuario10@correo.com"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/ulises_BORRAR
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}




### CREAR TURNO PRUEBAS 1
POST http://localhost:3000/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

{ 
    "clientName": "Luciano",
    "clientEmail": "lucianoApp@correo.com",
    "date": "2026-10-10T19:30:00.000Z", 
    "service": "Barba"
}

### CREAR TURNO PRUEBAS 2
POST http://localhost:3000/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

{ 
    "clientName": "Ulises",
    "clientEmail": "ulises@correo.com",
    "date": "2026-10-10T19:30:00.000Z", 
    "service": "Corte de pelo"
}

### VER TODOS LOS TURNOS
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}


### CAMBIAR ESTADO DE UN TURNO
PATCH http://localhost:3000/appointments/6a74e6c5c4255f982f2f3e91/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

{
    "status": "confirmed"
}

### BORRAR UN TURNO
DELETE http://localhost:3000/appointments/6a74e6c5c4255f982f2f3e91
Authorization: {{loginAdmin.response.headers.Authorization}}

